{
  "sn10.8:0.1": "Linked Discourses 10.8 ",
  "sn10.8:0.2": "1. With Indaka ",
  "sn10.8:0.3": "With Sudatta ",
  "sn10.8:1.1": "At one time the Buddha was staying near Rājagaha in the Cool Grove. ",
  "sn10.8:1.2": "Now at that time the householder Anāthapiṇḍika had arrived at Rājagaha on some business. ",
  "sn10.8:1.3": "He heard ",
  "sn10.8:1.4": "a rumor that a Buddha had arisen in the world. ",
  "sn10.8:1.5": "Right away he wanted to go and see the Buddha, but he thought, ",
  "sn10.8:1.6": "“It’s too late to go and see the Buddha today. ",
  "sn10.8:1.7": "I’ll go and see him tomorrow.” He went to bed thinking of the Buddha. ",
  "sn10.8:1.8": "During the night he got up three times thinking it was sunup. ",
  "sn10.8:1.9": "Then he approached the Sivaka Gate, ",
  "sn10.8:1.10": "and non-human beings opened it for him. ",
  "sn10.8:1.11": "But as he was leaving the city, light vanished and darkness appeared to him. He felt fear, terror, and goosebumps, and wanted to turn back. ",
  "sn10.8:1.12": "Then the invisible spirit Sivaka called out: ",
  "sn10.8:2.1": "“A hundred elephants, a hundred horses, ",
  "sn10.8:2.2": "a hundred mule-drawn chariots, ",
  "sn10.8:2.3": "a hundred thousand maidens ",
  "sn10.8:2.4": "bedecked with jeweled earrings: ",
  "sn10.8:2.5": "these are not worth a sixteenth part ",
  "sn10.8:2.6": "of a single forward stride! ",
  "sn10.8:3.1": "Forward, householder! ",
  "sn10.8:3.2": "Forward, householder! ",
  "sn10.8:3.3": "Going forward is better for you